{"schemaVersion":1,"id":501,"sections":[{"id":"1920001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20681],"start":0,"count":13},{"id":"1920001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20682],"start":13,"count":13}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:1","scriptId":20681,"text":"在周边的几个奇怪的哨点，我们也发现了异常的钢舞姬和守备队。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:2","scriptId":20681,"text":"“虽然早有准备，但要攻击自己人总有那么点不舒服。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:3","scriptId":20681,"text":"“是的，但这次是有准备的，直接使用了麻醉弹。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:4","scriptId":20681,"text":"“是啊，波西娅制作的麻醉弹效果真不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:5","scriptId":20681,"text":"“那本来是对战车兽用的麻醉弹……剂量大得很，我还担心麻醉过量的问题呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:6","scriptId":20681,"text":"“麻醉过量也不会怎么样吧？不过就是多睡会儿咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:7","scriptId":20681,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:8","scriptId":20681,"text":"“麻醉过量可能会导致心肺功能停止，弄不巧会出人命的，姐姐……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:9","scriptId":20681,"text":"“诶？那……那么危险？那就别用了呀。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:10","scriptId":20681,"text":"“没办法，现在我们也只有这个手段可以制伏异常的钢舞姬，或者说你有其他更好的方法？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:11","scriptId":20681,"text":"“唔……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:12","scriptId":20681,"text":"（虽然麻醉弹效果良好，但我们也只能期望不要遇到太多此类情况，不然麻醉弹一旦用完就只能依靠实弹了。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-PROLOGUE:20681:13","scriptId":20681,"text":"“继续出发吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:1","scriptId":20682,"text":"“异常钢舞姬的情况传达到上面的话，估计又要引起轰动了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:2","scriptId":20682,"text":"“很不妙啊，这次的情况如果公开出去可能对钢舞姬的名声会造成很大损伤，就怕某些人又要上纲上线。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:3","scriptId":20682,"text":"“确实……本来就有不少人对使用战车兽核心颇有微词，而且确实也存在钢舞姬兽化的个案，只不过风险评估都被上头压下去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:4","scriptId":20682,"text":"“这个消息如果传出去的话，世间对钢舞姬的反面评价又要被推上风口浪尖，简直是授人以柄。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:5","scriptId":20682,"text":"“我可不想被当成战车兽看待。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:6","scriptId":20682,"text":"“所以这次任务除了寻人以外，我们还要注意封锁消息并调查整个事件的来龙去脉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:7","scriptId":20682,"text":"“那之前不是还遇到了蕾贝卡么……封锁消息好像就没戏了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:8","scriptId":20682,"text":"“你当蕾贝卡跟你一样没脑子吗？她聪明着呢，不会到处乱说的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:9","scriptId":20682,"text":"“唔……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:10","scriptId":20682,"text":"“好了，不聊有的没的了，休息地也差不多了，先散开队伍侦查一下周围，指不定又有伪造的中继站。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:11","scriptId":20682,"text":"“哼，知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:12","scriptId":20682,"text":"“了解。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1920001-EPILOGUE:20682:13","scriptId":20682,"text":"“啊呀呀，维卡已经出发了呢，我们也要跟上啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
